L4-E13 (MESHSAT-1357): U-03, A PANEL WHOSE MAKER'S DOCUMENT BOUNDS ITS OPEN-CIRCUIT VOLTAGE AT THE COLDEST OPERATING
TEMPERATURE INSIDE REQ-016'S WINDOW. Prototype design, desk arithmetic: nothing bought, built, powered or measured.

